@startuml
left to right direction

title Use Case Diagram for AI-Powered Analysis & Insights System

:Client: as Client
:System Admin: as SysAdmin
:Financial Advisor: as FAFD

rectangle "System" {
  usecase "CFR001: View Financial Insights Dashboard" as CFR001
  usecase "SAFR001: Manage Analysis Parameters" as SAFR001
  
  Client --> (SFR012) : generates client dashboards that present financial information in an intuitive and actionable format.
  Client --> (SFR013) : generates client alerts based on predefined conditions to ensure timely notification of important financial events.
  Client --> (AIFR004) : generate investment opportunity analyses for users by evaluating potential investments against their risk profiles, time horizons, and financial goals.
  
  SysAdmin --> SAFR001
  SysAdmin --> (SFR020) : manage user feedback to continuously improve the quality and relevance of financial insights.
  
  FAFD --> (FAFR003) : view predictive analytics about my clients' financial situations to provide data-driven recommendations during consultations.
  FAFD --> (FAFR015) : generate client predictive intervention recommendations by identifying patterns that indicate potential financial difficulties or opportunities requiring advisor engagement.
}
@enduml